{
  "book": "jacob",
  "bookName": "Jacob",
  "chapter": 6,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 185.689,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.718,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, behold, my brethren,",
      "verse": "6:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 1.898,
      "end": 4.452,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as I said unto you that I would prophesy,",
      "verse": "6:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 4.632,
      "end": 6.768,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, this is my prophecy\u2014",
      "verse": "6:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 6.948,
      "end": 11.871,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the things which this prophet Zenos spake concerning the house of Israel,",
      "verse": "6:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 12.051,
      "end": 15.534,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the which he likened them unto a tame olive tree,",
      "verse": "6:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 15.714,
      "end": 17.386,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "must surely come to pass.",
      "verse": "6:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 18.066,
      "end": 21.595,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the day that he shall set his hand again the second time",
      "verse": "6:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 21.775,
      "end": 25.676,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to recover his people, is the day, yea, even the last time,",
      "verse": "6:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 25.856,
      "end": 28.921,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the servants of the Lord shall go forth in his power,",
      "verse": "6:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 29.101,
      "end": 31.423,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to nourish and prune his vineyard;",
      "verse": "6:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 31.603,
      "end": 33.971,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and after that the end soon cometh.",
      "verse": "6:2",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 34.651,
      "end": 39.202,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And how blessed are they who have labored diligently in his vineyard;",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 39.382,
      "end": 43.329,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and how cursed are they who shall be cast out into their own place!",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 43.509,
      "end": 45.738,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the world shall be burned with fire.",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 46.418,
      "end": 49.019,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And how merciful is our God unto us,",
      "verse": "6:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 49.199,
      "end": 53.889,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he remembereth the house of Israel, both roots and branches;",
      "verse": "6:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 54.069,
      "end": 57.738,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he stretches forth his hands unto them all the day long;",
      "verse": "6:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 57.918,
      "end": 61.447,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they are a stiffnecked and a gainsaying people;",
      "verse": "6:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 61.627,
      "end": 65.946,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but as many as will not harden their hearts shall be saved in the kingdom of God.",
      "verse": "6:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 66.626,
      "end": 71.827,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, my beloved brethren, I beseech of you in words of soberness",
      "verse": "6:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 72.007,
      "end": 73.54,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye would repent,",
      "verse": "6:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 73.72,
      "end": 76.228,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and come with full purpose of heart,",
      "verse": "6:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 76.408,
      "end": 79.38,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and cleave unto God as he cleaveth unto you.",
      "verse": "6:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 79.56,
      "end": 83.972,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And while his arm of mercy is extended towards you in the light of the day,",
      "verse": "6:5",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 84.152,
      "end": 85.731,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "harden not your hearts.",
      "verse": "6:5",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 86.411,
      "end": 90.544,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, today, if ye will hear his voice, harden not your hearts;",
      "verse": "6:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 90.724,
      "end": 92.349,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for why will ye die?",
      "verse": "6:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 93.029,
      "end": 97.348,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, after ye have been nourished by the good word of God all the day long,",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 97.528,
      "end": 99.478,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "will ye bring forth evil fruit,",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 99.658,
      "end": 102.63,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye must be hewn down and cast into the fire?",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 103.31,
      "end": 105.4,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, will ye reject these words?",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 105.58,
      "end": 108.134,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Will ye reject the words of the prophets;",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 108.314,
      "end": 112.726,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and will ye reject all the words which have been spoken concerning Christ,",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 112.906,
      "end": 115.692,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after so many have spoken concerning him;",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 115.872,
      "end": 118.055,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and deny the good word of Christ,",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 118.235,
      "end": 119.907,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the power of God,",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 120.087,
      "end": 122.223,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the gift of the Holy Ghost,",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 122.403,
      "end": 124.168,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and quench the Holy Spirit,",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 124.348,
      "end": 127.413,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and make a mock of the great plan of redemption,",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 127.593,
      "end": 129.172,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which hath been laid for you?",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 129.852,
      "end": 132.546,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Know ye not that if ye will do these things,",
      "verse": "6:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 132.726,
      "end": 135.93,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the power of the redemption and the resurrection,",
      "verse": "6:9",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 136.11,
      "end": 137.55,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which is in Christ,",
      "verse": "6:9",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 137.73,
      "end": 142.142,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "will bring you to stand with shame and awful guilt before the bar of God?",
      "verse": "6:9",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 142.822,
      "end": 145.237,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And according to the power of justice,",
      "verse": "6:10",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 145.417,
      "end": 147.46,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for justice cannot be denied,",
      "verse": "6:10",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 147.64,
      "end": 151.169,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye must go away into that lake of fire and brimstone,",
      "verse": "6:10",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 151.349,
      "end": 153.671,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whose flames are unquenchable,",
      "verse": "6:10",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 153.851,
      "end": 157.102,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and whose smoke ascendeth up forever and ever,",
      "verse": "6:10",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 157.282,
      "end": 160.486,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which lake of fire and brimstone is endless torment.",
      "verse": "6:10",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 161.166,
      "end": 163.906,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O then, my beloved brethren, repent ye,",
      "verse": "6:11",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 164.086,
      "end": 166.408,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and enter in at the strait gate,",
      "verse": "6:11",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 166.588,
      "end": 169.328,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and continue in the way which is narrow,",
      "verse": "6:11",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 169.508,
      "end": 171.737,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until ye shall obtain eternal life.",
      "verse": "6:11",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 172.417,
      "end": 174.507,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O be wise; what can I say more?",
      "verse": "6:12",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 175.187,
      "end": 177.091,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Finally, I bid you farewell,",
      "verse": "6:13",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 177.271,
      "end": 180.243,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until I shall meet you before the pleasing bar of God,",
      "verse": "6:13",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 180.423,
      "end": 183.999,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which bar striketh the wicked with awful dread and fear.",
      "verse": "6:13",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 184.179,
      "end": 185.015,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Amen.",
      "verse": "6:13",
      "lineIndex": 60
    }
  ]
}